# Cloudflare reads this file and applies it to static assets only; /api/* runs
# the Worker first. The first rule sets security headers on every page. The
# second sandboxes the build's emitted assets: an SVG figure opened directly
# then runs nothing on the site's origin, and a CSP on a script, stylesheet or
# font loaded by a page has no effect. The third keeps PR previews on
# toolkit.noppu.dev out of search results without touching production.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
/_astro/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; img-src data:; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; sandbox
https://:preview.toolkit.noppu.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
